At Art Kib[but]z Jeremy participated as a member of the Jewish Plays Project team rehearsing[ to] present excerpts from[ And] You[ Shall Be A] Blessing[,] a play with music about Debbie Friedman[.] The play took place on June 11th at the 14th Street Y at 10 pm as part of the Tikkun[ Le]il Shavuot event - with Shira Kline, Naomi[ Less], Sarah Sokolic, Michael Bradley Cohen, Deborah Yarchun, and Max Jared. More here.[]

